\b Upload Services\b0\
{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://betadrop.app"}}{\fldrslt BetaDrop}} hosts builds and install pages.\
{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://streamshare.wireway.ch"}}{\fldrslt StreamShare}} hosts StreamShare uploads, which are public to anyone with the link.\
{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://axorax.github.io/urlmskr/"}}{\fldrslt Urlmskr}} turns StreamShare install links into web links.\
{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://ulvis.net"}}{\fldrslt Ulvis}}, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://spoo.me"}}{\fldrslt Spoo.me}}, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cleanuri.com"}}{\fldrslt CleanURI}} and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://tinyurl.com"}}{\fldrslt TinyURL}} shorten StreamShare install links, tried in that order.\
SignDrop is not affiliated with these services.\
